== program: deploy drift
  - error.log (file, only on the server)
  - uploads (dir, only on the server)
  ~ app.js (file, differs)
  ~ build-id (file, differs)
  ~ changelog.txt (file, differs)
  ~ style.css (file, differs)
  ~ version.txt (file, differs)
  ! assets (?, cannot be compared)
  ! dangling (?, cannot be compared)
  - api/v1/legacy.html (file, only on the server)
  ~ api/v1/orders.html (file, differs)
  - img/old-logo.svg (file, only on the server)
  ~ img/banner.png (file, differs)
  ~ search/index.json (file, differs)
