  backup-tue -> backup-wed: 4 names
    shallow: same ['orders.sql', 'users.sql'], changed ['audit.log'], missing ['payments.sql']
    deep:    same ['orders.sql'], changed ['audit.log', 'users.sql'], missing ['payments.sql']
    changed but missed by the shallow check: ['users.sql']
== program: mirror sync
  copy LICENSE
  copytree docs
  copytree tests
  update setup.cfg
  rmtree build
  copy tool/util.py
  update tool/__init__.py
  remove tool/old.py
  copy tool/plugins/json.py
  remove tool/plugins/xml.py
  10 steps
